<section class="section"><div class="shell prose-grid"><p class="eyebrow">Product direction</p><div class="prose"><h2>Help businesses answer well, even when people are busy.</h2><p>Heela is being developed to support business phone communication with AI-powered call handling. The platform is intended to help businesses respond consistently and manage common caller needs.</p><p>Potential business use cases include handling routine enquiries, directing calls appropriately and supporting teams when they cannot answer immediately.</p><h3>Key capabilities in focus</h3><ul><li>AI-powered call handling</li><li>Consistent responses for common enquiries</li><li>Call routing and information capture</li><li>Support for busy customer-facing teams</li></ul><p class="legal">Heela is in development. Capabilities may change before launch.</p></div></div></section>
